    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/456032%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Mineral springs located at modern Lamezia Terme in Italy's Cantanzaro province. There is some archaeological evidence for exploitation of the springs in antiquity, but the current spa complex is completely modern in date. Some scholars have suggested that the Terme di Caronte may correspond to the \"Aquae angae\" mentioned on the Peutinger Map.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/904435019> .

