    dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jnovotny>;
    dcterms:description "One of the name of Nippur according to the so-called “Nippur Compendium” and is “the place in which mankind was created and where oracles are perfected.” The goddess Ištar (as Ungal-Nibri/Šarrat-Nippuri) is said to have been its ruler.";
