    rdfs:label "Gaĭ-Kodzor";
    rdfs:comment "Village in Krasnodar Krai, Russia, located 9 km. southeast of Anapa. Between 1972 and 1986, several separate coin hoards dated to the late Bosporan Kingdom (4th century CE) were found on a farm at the edge of the village.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/916419409> .

