<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/919662720%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Assur Archive 49";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/893945%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "In the area of private houses in gB9I, excavators discovered a small archive of 3 clay tablets and an envelope. The archive, dating between 655 and postcanonical 641* BC, consists of loan documents concerning silver and barley.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/919662720> .

