<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/920277483%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Burkhan Khaldun";
    rdfs:comment "Burkhan Khaldun is a mountain that forms part of one of the Khentii Mountains located in the Khentii Province of northeastern Mongolia. The mountain and/or its vicinity is believed to be the birthplace and site of the tomb of Genghis Khan. The mountain and its landscapes were inscribed as a UNESCO World Heritage Site on 4 July 2015 under the heading \"Great Burkhan Khaldun Mountain and its surrounding sacred landscape.\"";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/920277483> .

