<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/921404713/ebabbarra> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jnovotny>;
    dcterms:description "The “temple of the god Šamaš” is referred to by the Sumerian name Ebabbarra in the Götteradressbuch of Ashur (Recensions A and B). The ceremonial name means \"Shining House.\"";
    dcterms:modified "2022-06-07T06:10:04-04:00";
