    dcterms:description "The “temple of the god Sîn” is referred to by the Sumerian name Eḫulḫuldirdirra in the Götteradressbuch of Ashur (Recensions A and B). The ceremonial name means \"House of Surpassing Joys.”";
    dcterms:modified "2022-06-07T06:10:05-04:00";
