<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/960808205%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Vico Pancellorum";
    rdfs:comment "In the introductory essay for Map 41 of the Barrington Atlas published in the Map-by-Map Directory, Vico Pancellorum is mentioned as a toponym with likely ancient origins, but absent is any specific evidence to that effect. Vico Pancellorum is a small Tuscan village located in the Province of Lucca. It is situated at 630 meters above sea level at the foot of Balzo Nero.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/960808205> .

<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/960808205/osm-location-of-vico-pancellorum> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jbecker>;
