<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/970142378%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Loron workshop (Croatia)  ";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/786880550%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Located in the territory of Parentium (Poreč, Croatia), Loron was one of the largest Dressel 6B amphorae workshops in Adriatic (1st-4th centuries CE). It belonged to important senators like Sisenna Statilius Taurus and Calvia Crispinilla before its integration in the imperial property from the reign of Domitian (81 CE).";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/970142378> .

