<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/971899%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Uraz Bacha";
    rdfs:comment "An archaeological site with evidence of three settlement mounds. Phases of identifiable human activity include the Hellenistic period at Mound B (3rd-1st century B.C.) and Hepthalo-Turk (5th-9th century A.D.) at Mounds A and C. Traces of Islamic activity also were detected.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/971899> .

