        <https://www.cambridge.org/core/journals/libyan-studies/article/abs/new-data-from-jebel-moya-and-shaqadud-central-sudan-implications-for-late-mesolithic-interconnectivity-with-the-sahara/EF32B57B65CB5FF9E8B0C216289C8B36>,
        <https://www.jstor.org/stable/529898>,
