<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/911483313> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/vocab#Place>;
    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Nimrud Project (ORACC) Ancient Kalhu: The ziggurat and its temples (S. Zamazalová)",
        "Oates 2004 107–110",
        "RLAss Kalhu §10",
        "Reade 2002 ";
    dcterms:contributor <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jbecker>,
