    dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jbecker>;
    dcterms:description "The Sixth Dynasty vizier Kagemni was buried in a large limestone mastaba at Saqqara. It is the largest mastaba in the Teti cemetery. Its relief program includes well-preserved depictions of quotidian life in ancient Egypt.";
