    dcterms:contributor <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/thomase>;
    dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/zrosalinsky>;
    dcterms:description "A Bronze Age settlement with burial mounds outside it, located in the modern the Terek River in Russia's Stavropol Krai. Scholars interpret this site as one of several defining the \"Maykop culture\", which flourished during the fourth millennium BCE in the western Caucasus.";
