    dcterms:description "Dal'verzin tepe is an archaeological site located in Uzbekistan. The site is located near the Surkhan­darya River, approximately 60 km northeast of Termez. The settlement has its origins as a Greco-Bactrian town that developed into a larger, fortified settlement.";
