    rdfs:label "Sardinia (late Roman province)";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/981548%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The Late Roman province of Sardinia was organized under a praeses during the reign of Diocletian. In the fifth century (455) the island was occupied by the Vandals. Justinian I reclaimed the island in 534 and it remained under Byzantine control until the eleventh century.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/991344> .

