    dcterms:description "The so-called \"House of the Tragic Poet\" (VI, 8, 3, 5) was built in the first century BC and has the plan of a classic \"Samnite\" house. The house was excavated in 1824. It lies at the corner of the Via delle Terme and the Via della Fullonica, across from the Forum Baths.";
