    dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Arachne Regio IX: Hadrianstempel, Pantheon, Stadium Domitiani, Circus Flaminius, Pompeiustheater Museo della Civiltà Romana, Rom",
        "TM GEO ID 43715: Regio IX",
        "Wikidata Regio IX Circus Flaminius (Q17154578)",
        "Wikipedia (English) Regio IX Circus Flaminius",
        "van Heck 1977 pp. 371-438";
    dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jbecker>;
    dcterms:description "The ninth administrative region of the city of Rome was created under the Augustan reforms of 7 BCE. According to the Notitia et Curiosum, this region contained 35 shrines (aediculae), 140 townhouses (domūs), 25 warehouses (horrea), 63 bathhouses, and 120 fountains). The region was subdivided into 35 vici (districts) and 2,777 insulae (blocks). It had two curators and 48 Roman magistrates.";
    dcterms:modified "2026-03-21T22:22:15-04:00";
